    [33m       the objective and constraint functions by linear interpolation.[39;49;00m
    [33m       1994. Advances in Optimization and Numerical Analysis, eds. S. Gomez[39;49;00m
    [33m       and J-P Hennart, Kluwer Academic (Dordrecht), 51-67.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [10] Powell M J D. Direct search algorithms for optimization[39;49;00m
