>           [94mraise[39;49;00m [96mValueError[39;49;00m([33m"[39;49;00m[33m'[39;49;00m[33mx0[39;49;00m[33m'[39;49;00m[33m must only have one dimension.[39;49;00m[33m"[39;49;00m)[90m[39;49;00m
