    [33m        191-208.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [3] Powell, M J D. 1964. An efficient method for finding the minimum of[39;49;00m
    [33m       a function of several variables without calculating derivatives. The[39;49;00m
    [33m       Computer Journal 7: 155-162.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [4] Press W, S A Teukolsky, W T Vetterling and B P Flannery.[39;49;00m
    [33m       Numerical Recipes (any edition), Cambridge University Press.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [5] Nocedal, J, and S J Wright. 2006. Numerical Optimization.[39;49;00m
    [33m       Springer New York.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [6] Byrd, R H and P Lu and J. Nocedal. 1995. A Limited Memory[39;49;00m
    [33m       Algorithm for Bound Constrained Optimization. SIAM Journal on[39;49;00m
    [33m       Scientific and Statistical Computing 16 (5): 1190-1208.[39;49;00m
    [33m    .. [7] Zhu, C and R H Byrd and J Nocedal. 1997. L-BFGS-B: Algorithm[39;49;00m
